=== Tangent / uniformizer (Silverman II.1, Math 223) ===

Construction at smooth P = (x0, y0):
  m = 3*x0^2 / (2*y0) mod p
  l(x,y) = (y - y0) - m*(x - x0)   [tangent line, order-1 zero at P]
  uniformizer t ~ (x - x0)  or  l/l'  with l'(P) != 0

