=== VERDICT ===
Tangent m is LOCAL geometry at P; Lambda_p is GLOBAL slot ratio — different objects.
m%LO does not systematically equal (d - shelf2) on solved puzzles.
Wise direction for theory: use tangent/uniformizer for LOCAL parameter at P,
  chord slopes for P-R relation, Lambda for slot bridge — do not identify them.
